        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nAlthough I do find it useful for some use cases, this doesn't look like a good fit for a separate module. I'll think about maybe adding it in some capacity to 'mini.misc', but currently I have doubts about this.",
